<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>God Socials (220)</h1>
<p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>flick [&lt;someone&gt;]
mash [&lt;someone&gt;]
rock [&lt;someone&gt;]
</pre>
<p>Socials only gods may use, from level 220: they act out the might of the 
gods, and do no harm.
</p>
<ul><li><b>flick</b>: a giant finger appears from the sky and flicks someone across the room, or flicks the ground so that the earth quakes.</li>
<li><b>mash</b>: a giant fist appears from the sky and smashes someone into the ground, or smashes the ground.</li>
<li><b>rock</b>: you pick someone up and add them to your bag of rocks, or shuffle your bag of rocks.</li></ul>
<p>Without a name, the god acts on the ground or their bag. The one you 
name must be here and not asleep. There used to be a slime social too; 
it is gone.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Socials</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Wizhelp Echo</a>
</pre>




</div>